{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219690/extras/end_page.png?t=1748232215\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Action and rhythm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a unique universe blending rhythm and combat! Earn attack points by playing with the tempo, optimize your dodges, strike, and launch enemies into the air to chain combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219690/extras/anim_store_0.gif?t=1748232215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the secrets of the primordial planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your combat style as you like, or adjust the difficulty through various game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a classic mode filled with biomes and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a Boss Rush mode for the daring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a relaxed mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219690/extras/anim_spider.gif?t=1748232215\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo lets you explore the first level and its boss, fight part of the bestiary, and try out the level 1 skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219690/extras/small_banner_shop.jpg?t=1748232215\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I want more","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219690/23e12235250a96be16684ddb9d4bd24705d6574b.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219690?t=1748232215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219690/9